            "review_text": "Joo N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam111 contributions\n0\nRomantic & Beautiful City View\nDec 2015 • Business\nI stayed in this hotel and found that Roof Garden Restaurant very private and romantic place, I have invited friend to come here for drink and we had couple of drink was very good, staffs was very friendly (we have no meal as we ate already in its restaurant in the first floor)\nWritten December 12, 2015",
