            "review_text": "DaveLD1\nLondon, United Kingdom87 contributions\n0\nWorth it for the view!\nJun 2015 • Solo\nOutside sitting with a wonderful view of the city, you normally get a light breeze which helps with the humidity. Reasonable choice and the food is in generally very good, staff are helpful and friendly. If you are doing more than one course it may be worth mentioning that you don't want everything at the same time. Also doubles as an outside Bar\nNice way to spend an evening\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 22, 2015",
