            "review_text": "mikael.bjerrum\nCopenhagen, Denmark739 contributions\n0\nWeekend buffet is excelent\nDec 2014 • Couples\nThe Roof Garden restaurant is located inside the Grand Silverland & Spa Hotel. At weekends they serve a buffet for around 600,000 VDN for two persons (you can also enjoy as one person at 388,000 VDN). You can choose hot pot, barbecue and a variety of ready cooked dishes. Even cheese, fruit and desert is included in the price. All the food is delicious and the service is great. You will not leave hungry. And one more thing: amazing views over Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 8, 2014",
