            "review_text": "bradpittph\nBoracay, Philippines212 contributions\n0\nYou will not leave hungry!\nSep 2014 • Solo\nUnfortunately, they have changed the buffet again, so that it is only available Friday-Sunday. The menu is different now than when I visited, so you will have to check-out the current offerings.\n\nOne thing that disappointed me is that they price the buffet such that you get a 1/3 discount for a group of two or more. While I can understand this type of pricing for limited commodities, such as hotel rooms or very busy restaurants, it makes no sense here.\n\nOn my first visit, I ate with a friend and the bill worked-out to about 300,000VND (US <$15). On my next two visits, I ate alone (actually ate less than the first time), and the bill was 450,000VND (US $22.50). This is ridiculous.\n\nThe meal is worth 300,000VND only. The restaurant was never so busy that they should feel the need to upcharge a single-diner. This policy should be changed.\n\nThe staff were quite helpful and friendly, but they could not overcome this policy. There are less expensive places for buffets that are nearby, but since I was staying in the hotel, it was more convenient to eat here.\n\nThe food offers and excellent selection and the beer prices are not too bad. You do get one beer or wine with your meal at no charge.\n\nI would recommend the food, but bring a friend...\n\nHours of operation are Friday-Sunday from 6pm-10pm.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 8, 2014",
